{"4564400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "THE HALLWAY", "steam_appid": 4564400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>!!! This game is a command-line game and is only available to Windows Users !!!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564400/extras/17195065e27c4879fcf52b66511305c3.avif?t=1785439039\" width=1440 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>THE HALLWAY:</strong></i> A chilling text-based horror experience set in a dark, narrow corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of an unnamed protagonist, wandering through the oppressive shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no matter how far you go, something drags you back. Over and over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564400/extras/746b83e3b736cfbae06eb58d374a7f0e.avif?t=1785439039\" width=1440 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Horrifying, Jaw-Dropping Story:</strong> <i>THE HALLWAY</i> weaves a unique and unsettling narrative that slowly unravels the truth behind your confinement... and the reason you were brought here in the first place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564400/extras/1f54fe4b21e4ca07c2736320059fd502.avif?t=1785439039\" width=1440 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looping Mechanics:</strong> Every loop, things <i>will change. </i>The hallway <i>twists</i> itself in quiet, unsettling ways. Doors locked, entire sections disappearing, rooms more degraded than before... it’s not just repeating… it’s <i>evolving.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564400/extras/e9e5c9f3d0f33de511ce29a70e6d69b6.avif?t=1785439039\" width=1440 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices Matter:</strong> Your decisions shape the gameplay with a unique stat system, the game tracks your decisions. Which of the <strong><i>four</i></strong> endings will you get?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564400/extras/3ce220fcb9a47b39f6e24ba053567ea5.avif?t=1785439039\" width=1440 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> <i>THE HALLWAY</i> includes carefully crafted puzzles that align with the narrative, each one uncovering pieces of the mystery as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564400/extras/d6fd0babacce5fb6a94e2e0d48357fa1.avif?t=1785439039\" width=1440 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong>: <i>THE HALLWAY</i> comes with <i><strong>twenty</strong></i> unlockable achievements enhancing replay-ability, and encouraging exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564400/extras/963783830c371dcc26bbd1f8552ec772.avif?t=1785439039\" width=1440 height=270 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>!!! This game is a command-line game and is only available to Windows Users !!!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564400/extras/17195065e27c4879fcf52b66511305c3.avif?t=1785439039\" width=1440 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>THE HALLWAY:</strong></i> A chilling text-based horror experience set in a dark, narrow corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of an unnamed protagonist, wandering through the oppressive shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no matter how far you go, something drags you back. Over and over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564400/extras/746b83e3b736cfbae06eb58d374a7f0e.avif?t=1785439039\" width=1440 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Horrifying, Jaw-Dropping Story:</strong> <i>THE HALLWAY</i> weaves a unique and unsettling narrative that slowly un